4	 * Transforms raw AL score into vivid, personality-driven prompt text that naturally
5	 * guides LLM decisions without "MUST act" directives.
6	 *
7	 * 5 components compose each instinct description:
8	 * 1. Intensity (7 tiers from score)
9	 * 2. Texture (3 severity classes: emotional / calculating / primal)
10	 * 3. Motivation (Enneagram core fear/desire)
11	 * 4. Resistance (opposing PM traits → counter-voice)
12	 * 5. Escalation + Mood coloring
